---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Worked examples of AI agents and automation in small and mid-sized businesses.
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Blog</h1>
    <p>Worked examples of AI agents in real businesses: the problem, what we'd build, and what it takes.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="blog-list">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.posts.length %}
    <ul class="post-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    <p>New use-case write-ups are on the way.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
